- a reshape of the inline holder that stores it (push, insert, remove, sort, swap);
- verdict 114's move of an object holding it.
A reload that would migrate it is refused in plan (HR-45). The help keeps each frame in a block of its own: `gens: Array[owns dyn Iterator[Item = int]]` and `gens.push(owns walk(100))`.

